{"schema_version": 5, "unit_id": "tag:08MJ:statement", "parent_tag": "08MA", "chapter": "defos", "node_kind": "remark", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ringed topos. Let\n<MATH_0002>,\n<MATH_0003> be first order thickenings with ideal sheaves <MATH_0004>.\nLet <MATH_0005>\nbe a morphism of first order thickenings of <MATH_0006>.\nPicture\n<MATH_0007>\nObserve that <MATH_0008>\nin particular induces an <MATH_0009>-module map\n<MATH_0010>.\nLet <MATH_0011> be an <MATH_0012>-module.\nLet <MATH_0013>, <MATH_0014> be a pair\nconsisting of an <MATH_0015>-module <MATH_0016> and a map\n<MATH_0017>. Assume furthermore given a map\nof <MATH_0018>-modules <MATH_0019>\nsuch that\n<MATH_0020>\nis commutative. Then there is a canonical functoriality\n<MATHSEG_0001> as in <MATHSEG_0002> with <MATHSEG_0003> and <MATHSEG_0004> as in <MATHSEG_0005> with <MATHSEG_0006> and <MATHSEG_0007>\nNamely, thinking of all sheaves <MATH_0021>, <MATH_0022>,\n<MATH_0023>, <MATH_0024>, etc as sheaves on <MATH_0025>, we set\ngiven <MATH_0026> the sheaf <MATH_0027> equal to the\npushout, i.e., fitting into the following diagram of extensions\n<MATH_0028>\nWe omit the construction of the <MATH_0029>-module structure\non the pushout (this uses the commutativity of the diagram\ninvolving <MATH_0030> and <MATH_0031>).\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O}) \\to (\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}_i), \\mathcal{O}'_i)$", "MATH_0003": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{I}_i$", "MATH_0005": "$h : (\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}_1), \\mathcal{O}'_1) \\to\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}_2), \\mathcal{O}'_2)$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O})$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n& (\\Sh(\\mathcal{C}), \\mathcal{O}) \\ar[ld] \\ar[rd] & \\\\\n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}_1), \\mathcal{O}'_1) \\ar[rr]^h & & \n(\\Sh(\\mathcal{D}_2), \\mathcal{O}'_2)\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$h^\\sharp : \\mathcal{O}'_2 \\to \\mathcal{O}'_1$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{I}_2 \\to \\mathcal{I}_1$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0013": "$(\\mathcal{K}_i, c_i)$", "MATH_0014": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{K}_i$", "MATH_0017": "$c_i : \\mathcal{I}_i \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F} \\to\n\\mathcal{K}_i$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{K}_2 \\to \\mathcal{K}_1$", "MATH_0020": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{I}_2 \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F}\n\\ar[r]_-{c_2} \\ar[d] &\n\\mathcal{K}_2 \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{I}_1 \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{F}\n\\ar[r]^-{c_1} &\n\\mathcal{K}_1\n}\n$$", "MATHSEG_0001": "$$\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\mathcal{F}'_2\\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "(\\ref{equation-extension-ringed-topoi})", "MATHSEG_0003": "}\\\\\nc_2 = c_{\\mathcal{F}'_2}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0004": "}\\mathcal{K} = \\mathcal{K}_2\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\mathcal{F}'_1\\text{", "MATHSEG_0005": "(\\ref{equation-extension-ringed-topoi})", "MATHSEG_0006": "}\\\\\nc_1 = c_{\\mathcal{F}'_1}\\text{", "MATHSEG_0007": "}\\mathcal{K} = \\mathcal{K}_1\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right\\}\n$$", "MATH_0021": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0022": "$\\mathcal{O}'_i$", "MATH_0023": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0024": "$\\mathcal{K}_i$", "MATH_0025": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0026": "$\\mathcal{F}'_2$", "MATH_0027": "$\\mathcal{F}'_1$", "MATH_0028": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n0 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{K}_2 \\ar[r] \\ar[d] &\n\\mathcal{F}'_2 \\ar[r] \\ar[d] &\n\\mathcal{F} \\ar@{=}[d] \\ar[r] & 0 \\\\\n0 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{K}_1 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}'_1 \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{F} \\ar[r] & 0\n}\n$$", "MATH_0029": "$\\mathcal{O}'_1$", "MATH_0030": "$c_1$", "MATH_0031": "$c_2$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remark}\n\\label{remark-extension-functorial-ringed-topoi}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remark}"}, "math_text_regi